    {
      "title": "Gioi thieu",
      "text": "%md\n## Phan tich gia dien thoai 3 san (TGDD, CellphoneS, FPTShop)\nDu lieu: bang Hive **ecommerce_warehouse.products_hive** (Sqoop tu MySQL len HDFS). Moi doan ben duoi la 1 truy van HiveQL chay tren YARN.",
