            "data": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"markdown-body\"\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003ePhan tich gia dien thoai 3 san (TGDD, CellphoneS, FPTShop)\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDu lieu: bang Hive \u003cstrong\u003eecommerce_warehouse.products_hive\u003c/strong\u003e (Sqoop tu MySQL len HDFS). Moi doan ben duoi la 1 truy van HiveQL chay tren YARN.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e"
